    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8970" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθυπο-φέρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>reply, rejoin,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυνθάνομαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				54
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Inv.</u>
				4.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				7.44
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>use</i> a word or phrase <i>in reply</i> to a question, in 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				24.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Synt.</u>
				73.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>cause to retrogress,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.76d
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				939a
			</span></i>.</div>
